  "properties": {
    "title": "GRID3 COD - Health Facilities v2.0",
    "description": "The dataset consists of health facility points with name, location, health zone, and health area, among other attributes, for eleven provinces in the Democratic Republic of the Congo (COD). Province group 1: Haut-Katanga, Kasaï, Kasaï-Oriental, Kinshasa, and Lomami Province group 2: Haut-Lomami and Tanganyika Province group 3: Ituri and Kwilu Province group 4: Maniema Province group 5: Kasaï-Central This operational dataset has not been fully validated by government officials or ministries. The current version supersedes GRID3 COD - Health Facilities v1.0 (https://doi.org/10.7916/yran-5481). This current version includes the province of Kasaï-Central. Keywords: health facilities",
